BLE Clipboard is an independent, unofficial project for Flipper Zero.
It is not affiliated with Flipper Devices, Apple, or Homebrew.

The Flipper application uses the public Flipper Zero firmware SDK and its
Bluetooth, GUI, storage, and USB HID APIs. The SDK and firmware are maintained by
Flipper Devices Inc. and contributors:
https://github.com/flipperdevices/flipperzero-firmware

Source code in this repository is licensed under GPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE.
The SDK, firmware, Apple frameworks, and Homebrew retain their own licenses.

The macOS application icon was generated using OpenAI image generation and
adapted into Apple's ICNS sizes using sips and iconutil. The checked-in source
PNG is the master asset. See docs/ARTWORK.md for its generation prompt.

